### ============================================================
### CURRENCY EXCHANGE RATE & MARKET CONVERSION HTTP TEST SUITE
### Server IP: 192.168.2.114:8000
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://192.168.2.114:8000

### 1. Get Live USD/VND & CNY/VND Exchange Rates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exchange_rate
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get API System Health & Server Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Lowest Price Floor Across All 4 Platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lowest
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Historical Price Logs (POE 2 Divine Orb)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?item_name=POE%202%20Divine%20Orb
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Historical Price Logs (POE 1 Divine Orb)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?item_name=POE%201%20Divine%20Orb
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get G2G Snapshot Order Book (USD Prices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Eldorado Snapshot Order Book (USD Prices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eldorado/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get DD373 Snapshot Order Book (RMB Prices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dd373/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Qiandao Snapshot Order Book (RMB Prices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/qiandao/snapshot
Accept: application/json
